error[E0277]: cannot assign to a value of type `i32` under execution context `VMask<N>`
  --> tests/ui/uniform_assign.rs:14:7
   |
14 |     s = 5;
   |       ^ this assignment target cannot be written under the current control-flow mask
   |
   = help: the trait `spmd::MaskedAssign<VMask<N>, _>` is not implemented for `i32`
   = note: assigning to a uniform (scalar) variable under VARYING control flow is not supported: every lane would race on one location. Make the variable a `Varying`, hoist the assignment out of the varying branch, or wrap it in `unmasked!` if all-lanes semantics are intended
   = help: the following other types implement trait `spmd::MaskedAssign<E, V>`:
             `i32` implements `spmd::MaskedAssign<AllOn>`
             `i32` implements `spmd::MaskedAssign<BoolGuard>`
